+  breadcrumb, and is DISABLED unless ``CEO_CONTEXT_PROGRESS_FLOOR_TOKENS`` is
+  set. It cannot halt a compaction — PreCompact has no deny channel.
 - Stdlib only, Python >= 3.9.
@@ -50,3 +82,4 @@ via ``additionalContext``.
