   765	    names, anchor_source}`` — ``names`` (sanitized basenames, sorted, ≤
   766	    ``_MEMORY_DELTA_MAX_NAMES``) is rendered NOWHERE since rail r22 (the
   767	    operator line is counts-only; the list stays as the tested ingress
   768	    gate for any future render) and is never passed to audit_emit;
