    83	  (`test_audit_log_path_d.py`) asserts the table matches the
    84	  "Loads <skill> skill via reference" phrase in each
    85	  `.claude/agents/<archetype>.md` description frontmatter.
    86	
    87	  Sec MF-7 defense-in-depth: `subagent_type` is normalized via
    88	  `strip().lower()` (case-fold mirrors `check_agent_spawn.py:204`
    89	  archetype-routing precedent), then validated POST-NORMALIZE
    90	  against `_ARCHETYPE_NAME_RE` (`^[a-z][a-z0-9\\-]{0,63}$` with
    91	  `.fullmatch`). A raw-length pre-bound (`len > 80`) caps
    92	  hot-path allocation. Rejected silently: slash, dot-traversal,
    93	  NUL, unicode, oversize, non-string. Uppercase is INTENTIONALLY
    94	  case-folded (NOT rejected) — matches Agent-tool emitter
    95	  flexibility for the routing layer.
    96	
    97	## Rotation
    98	
    99	NEW in Sprint 2: monthly rotation by size threshold.
   100	
   101	Before writing, if `audit-log.jsonl` exists and its size > ROTATE_AT_BYTES
   102	(default 10 MB), rename to `audit-log-YYYY-MM.jsonl` (current month) and
   103	start a fresh file. If the monthly file already exists (second rotation
   104	in the same month), append `-1`, `-2`, etc.
   105	
   106	The rotation rename happens UNDER the lock so a concurrent writer can't
   107	append to a file that's about to be moved.
   108	
   109	## Safety properties
   110	
   111	1. Fail-open: any exception writes a breadcrumb to `audit-log.errors`
   112	   and exits 0. The user's session MUST NOT be blocked by this hook.
   113	2. Silent on stdout: composable with the reminder hook.
   114	3. Env-var overrides (`CEO_AUDIT_LOG_*`) for testability.
   115	4. Redaction via `_lib.redact` (property-tested).
   116	5. Locking via `_lib.filelock` (fcntl.flock).
   117	
   118	## Decomposition candidates
   119	
   120	This module has accreted ~7 responsibilities across PLAN-019..PLAN-079.
   121	Tracked decomposition targets for PLAN-085+ readers (NO extraction in
   122	PLAN-087 — doc-only surface; per `F-A-CR-D0016` P2 + PLAN-084 evolution
   123	roadmap):
