   125	- **Path A — `extract_skill()` extraction.** Lines for the 3-path
   126	  matrix (Format-A inline / Format-B reference / Format-C ``## SKILL
   127	  CONTENT`` block) plus Path D canonical archetype map are a
   128	  self-contained extraction target. Candidate destination:
