   130	  `.claude/scripts/extract-skill.py` — the in-hook copy duplicates
   131	  logic kept inline so audit-log emit covers the dispatch hot path
   132	  without subprocess fork). Extraction would centralize the regex
   133	  contract; trade-off is per-spawn import cost.
   134	- **Path B — `usage_metadata` / `cache_coverage_bps` derivation.** The
   135	  v2.7 / v2.8 schema bump logic (lines ~15-43 in this docstring) is
   136	  arithmetic on `tool_response`. Candidate destination:
