   122	# PLAN-179 W0 US2b — progress-guard floor. The plan's own words: "requer o `F`
   123	# medido acima; até lá o piso não tem valor honesto". So there is NO default
   124	# here: absent/malformed env => the guard is a NO-OP. Once W0 measures F and T
   125	# the operator sets the env var; a literal default would be a magic number
   126	# shipped ahead of its measurement.
   127	PROGRESS_FLOOR_ENV = "CEO_CONTEXT_PROGRESS_FLOOR_TOKENS"
