   129	# PLAN-179 W0 US2b / amendment 8.1 — WIRE CONTRACT for `context_pressure_observed`.
   130	#
   131	# INTEGRATION DEFECT CLOSED HERE (PLAN-179 W0/W1 cross-file pass): this hook
   132	# used to compute a TOKEN-COUNT bucket (`used_tokens // 10000`, clamped 999)
   133	# and emit it as `used_tokens_bucket=` alongside `floor_tokens=`. Neither field
   134	# name exists in `_lib/audit_emit._CONTEXT_PRESSURE_OBSERVED_ALLOWLIST`, whose
