     6	pointers ("re-read CLAUDE.md", "the active plan is PLAN-NNN") — but the
     7	measured Governance Decay failure (§2.2 of PLAN-179) is not "the model
     8	forgot WHERE the rules live", it is "the rules themselves were summarized
     9	away and the model then violated them". The mitigation is to quarantine a
    10	SMALL, CLOSED set of invariants from the lossy compression and re-state
    11	them verbatim after every compaction.
