    26	This module therefore performs **no file I/O whatsoever** — that property
    27	is asserted by a test that scans this source. Changing the pinned set is a
    28	canonical edit of ``.claude/hooks/_lib/`` and requires the Owner-signed
    29	sentinel ceremony (ADR-031), which is exactly the friction the set
    30	deserves.
