    33	
    34	Only invariants whose violation is **IRREVERSIBLE**. A big set re-creates
    35	the context-floor problem the plan is trying to solve (§2.1), and a rule
    36	that can be undone next turn does not need to survive compaction. Four
    37	entries today; the ceiling is deliberately low.
