.claude/plans/PLAN-167/rail/codex-r3.md:17214:.claude/adr/ADR-155-install-baseline-manifest.md:43:2. **(ii) Per-file classification.** Upgrade reworks directory-target overwrite from whole-tree `delete + cp -R` to a per-file walk calling `_classify_against_baseline(rel_file)` per file. Four outcomes keyed on baseline `H_base`, destination `H_dst` (recomputed this run), source `H_src` (recomputed this run): FRAMEWORK-CHANGED (`H_dst==H_base && H_src!=H_base`) → auto-update; ADOPTER-CUSTOMIZED (`H_dst!=H_base && H_src==H_base`) → preserve; CONFLICT (both differ) → refuse per `--on-conflict={refuse|theirs|backup}` (default `refuse` = per-file skip-and-report-and-CONTINUE, never abort the whole upgrade); manifest-line-absent/malformed/LINK → FALL BACK to today's `diff -q` warn-then-clobber.
